   "name": "Properties of ionic compounds",
   "definition": "Describe the properties of ionic compounds: \nhigh melting points and boiling points; \ngood electrical conductivity when aqueous or molten and poor when solid"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Properties of ionic compounds"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- Ionic compounds are usually **solid** at room temperature\n- They have **high **melting and boiling points\n- Ionic compounds are good conductors of electricity in the **molten** state or in** solution**\n- They are poor conductors in the solid state"
